BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:C.S. Lewis' The Screwtape Letters
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261111T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261111T210000
UID:55703c509bf43d10bb41b30044bc8483@ontaptickets.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://cdn.prod.discovery.evvnt.com/uploads/eve
 nt_image/3425217/event_image/TSL_Purdue_Calendar-Assets-1920x1080_a2.jpg
DESCRIPTION:A battle for your soul is being waged from an office in hell!
 \n\nDon’t miss The Screwtape Letters\, the provocative\, faithful and wi
 ckedly funny theatrical adaptation of C.S. Lewis’ classic novel about sp
 iritual warfare from a demon’s point of view.\n\nThe Screwtape Letters c
 reates a topsy-turvy\, morally inverted universe\, set in an eerily stylis
 h office in hell\, where God is called the “Enemy\,” and the devil is 
 referred to as “Our Father Below.” The play follows His Abysmal Sublim
 ity\, Screwtape\, as he strives to ruin the life and damn the soul of an u
 nsuspecting human on earth.\n\nBased on the book by the creator of The Chr
 onicles of Narnia\, The Wall Street Journal called it\, “One hell of a g
 ood show!" Newsweek ranked it among the best productions of the year in Ne
 w York City. The New York Times found it\, “Clever and satirical\,” an
 d Christianity Today said it is a “Profound experience.”\n\nDirected b
 y FPA Founder and Artistic Director Max McLean\, The Screwtape Letters has
  played to capacity audiences in major cities across the U.S.\, including 
 New York\, Los Angeles\, San Francisco\, Atlanta\, Boston\, Salt Lake City
 \, Orlando\, Seattle and Dallas and in London. Over 500\,000 people have s
 een the production\, which continues to attract a national following. Don
 ’t miss your chance to experience it live—get tickets now!\n\nThe Scre
 wtape Letters run time is 90 minutes with no intermission. It is recommend
 ed for ages 13 and older\, and children under age 4 are not admitted.\n\nA
  question and answer session follows the performance and is open to all at
 tendees.\n\n$30 under 30 Discount – if you are under 30 show ID at box o
 ffice.\n\nBIG SAVINGS for groups of 10 or more: Email groups@fpatheatre.co
 m\n\nAll tickets are subject to service fees and handling charges.\n\nNo r
 efunds or exchanges.\n\nONLY ONE CHANCE TO SEE THE SHOW!\nNov. 11th at 7:3
 0pm!
GEO:40.4253198;-86.9132974
LOCATION:Loeb Playhouse\, 128 Memorial Mall Drive\, West Lafayette\, 47907
URL:https://fpatheatre.com/tour/tsl-purdue-university/?utm_source=Evvnt&ut
 m_medium=Calendar+Listing&utm_campaign=TSL+-+Purdue+University#tickets
X-SOURCE:On Tap Tickets
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.ontaptickets.com/event-calendar.html
END:VEVENT
