 n Indianapolis through immersive dining experiences\, live chef competitio
 ns\, audience voting\, and unforgettable multi-course dinners benefiting c
 urrent and future culinary excellence.Understanding the Monumental Chef Sh
 owdownThe Monumental Chef Showdown is a community-driven culinary event cr
 eated by Kelly’s Fund to spotlight Indianapolis chefs while generating s
 upport for youth culinary education through the Junior Chef Academy.It is 
